.TH THME 1 "November 2026" "THME 0.2.0" "Epiphanes User Commands"
.SH NAME
thme \- Topological Heterogeneous Manifold Engine for LLM Optimization
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thme
[\fISUBCOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B THME
(Topological Heterogeneous Manifold Engine) is a pure-Rust framework for zero-copy LLM memory profiling, layer sensitivity estimation, Pareto precision optimization, speculative decoding drafting, hardware roofline boundary analysis, and autonomous closed-loop co-surgery.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBgui\fR, \fBui\fR
Launch the 60 FPS interactive native Desktop Studio GUI.
.TP
\fBinspect\fR \fIMODEL\fR
Inspect SafeTensors or GGUF tensor shapes, dtypes, and metadata zero-copy.
.TP
\fBprofile\fR \fIMODEL\fR
Profile layer topological sensitivity, SVD decay spectra, and KV-cache scaling.
.TP
\fBplan\fR \fIMODEL\fR
Generate heterogeneous precision Pareto allocation plans.
.TP
\fBvalidate\fR, \fBcheck\fR
Run quality gate perplexity validation between baseline and candidate models.
.TP
\fBtweak\fR, \fBsurgery\fR \fIMODEL\fR \fIRECIPE\fR
Apply declarative surgery recipes to model weights.
.TP
\fBreport\fR
Export optimization and sensitivity summary reports in Markdown or JSON.
.TP
\fBconvert\fR
Cross-convert model topology across 8 specialized AI paradigms.
.TP
\fBspeculate\fR
Synthesize draft models and evaluate multi-token speculative decoding speedups.
.TP
\fBroofline\fR
Profile model operational intensity against empirical hardware ceilings.
.TP
\fBexport\fR \fIMODEL\fR \fB--output\fR \fIOUT\fR
Export source-backed model as GGUF v3 or SafeTensors.
.TP
\fBinterop\fR
Generate PyTorch fine-tuning scripts and Hugging Face configuration files.
.TP
\fBmcp\fR, \fBdaemon\fR
Run Model Context Protocol JSON-RPC daemon for AI agent connectivity.
.TP
\fBco-surgery\fR, \fBcosurgery\fR
Run autonomous closed-loop Teacher-Student co-surgery optimization.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version information and exit.
